// Test.CopyPaste.ailang
// Focused headless harness — a copy of Main that boots the FULL display
// system (headless framebuffer, no evdev/TTY), opens a real Notepad window
// via AppHost, and drives the actual Ctrl+C / Ctrl+V keyboard path through
// AK_EventKey on the notepad's TEXTFIELD. No 156-step battery, no main loop.
//
// Build: ./ailang.x dev/compiler-regression/Test.CopyPaste.ailang -o test_copypaste.x
// Run:   ./test_copypaste.x
//
// Copyright (c) 2026 Sean Collins, 2 Paws Machine and Engineering. SCSL.

